          Warm Lunches
        </h2>
        <div class="h-[2px] w-24 bg-primary mx-auto"></div>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium leading-relaxed mt-8">
          Coming soon! We're preparing something special for you.
        </p>
      </div>
      
